        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Integrated call sets derived from low-coverage and whole-exome sequence data with additional imputed genotypes for 59 of the 137 GeT-RM Coriell samples as part of the 1000 Genomes Phase 3 data release. These Variant Call Format (VCF) files were reformatted according to the requirements specified by the PharmCAT tool.\r\n\r\nFor the newest release of PharmCAT, go to the PharmCAT website: pharmcat.org",
